### 1. Create Task #1 (POST) 
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks 
Content-Type: application/json 

{ 
    "title": "Master Spring Data JPA", 
    "description": "Connect TaskManager to H2 in-memory database" 
} 

### 2. Create Task #2 (POST) 
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks 
Content-Type: application/json 

{ 
    "title": "Write Unit Tests with JUnit 5", 
    "description": "Test TaskService using Mockito" 
} 

### 3. Fetch All Tasks (GET) 
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks 

### 4. Update Task #1 to Completed (PUT) 
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/1 
Content-Type: application/json 

{ 
    "title": "Master Spring Data JPA & H2 Database", 
    "description": "Successfully connected and mapped database entity!", 
    "completed": true 
}

### 5. Filter Only Incomplete Tasks (GET) 
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?completed=false 

### 6. Test Input Validation (Should return 400 Bad Request) 
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks 
Content-Type: application/json 

{
    "title": " ", 
    "description": "Blank title check" 
} 

### 7. Delete Task #1 (DELETE) 
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/1 

### 8. Verify Non-Existent Task (Should return 404 Not Found) 
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/999